<title>UK: GMAC launches dollar and yen bonds.</title>
<headline>GMAC launches dollar and yen bonds.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Merrill Lynch and Kokusai.</p>
<p> BORROWER   GENERAL MOTORS ACCEPTANCE CORP</p>
<p>TRANCHE A:</p>
<p> AMT    $178 MLN	COUPON     5.63	MATURITY    25.FEB.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    25.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.50	REOFFER    PAR	 LISTING     NONE</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 10	  PAY FREQ   SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>* * * * * * *</p>
<p>TRANCHE B:</p>
<p> AMT    11 BLN YEN    COUPON     5.64	MATURITY   *25.FEB.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    25.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.50	LISTING    NONE	DENOMS (K)  500</p>
<p> PAY FREQ   SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> NOTES	*REDEMPTION IN STERLING</p>
<p>		 ISSUED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
